#' Precomputed grouped MODGEE bootstrap example
#'
#' Generated by data-raw/example_bootstrap_result.R before installation.
#' Uses example_M, example_groups, reference group
#' "primary + old secondary", seed 123, ten scheduled replicates and CI 0.95.
#' Ten replicates demonstrate the interface, not stable statistical inference.
#'
#' @format A fit_modgee result list with a bootstrap component containing
#'   settings, status, summary, curve, group_results, diagnostics and replicates.
#' @details The checkpoint path is NULL for portability. Loading the object
#'   never runs bootstrap. Inspect bootstrap$status for the actual success count.
#'   This object supplies input to future plot_modgee interval examples.
#' @seealso \code{\link{fit_modgee}}, \code{\link{plot_modgee}}
#' @section Usage Examples:
#' \preformatted{
#' example_bootstrap_result$bootstrap$status
#' head(example_bootstrap_result$bootstrap$curve)
#' plot_modgee(example_bootstrap_result)
#' }
"example_bootstrap_result"
